    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>Mercy leaves a glow.</em></p><p>Whenever you <strong>heal</strong> a creature or successfully <strong>stabilize</strong> a dying creature using a manifestation, feature, or skill check, that creature also gains <strong>temporary Integrity equal to your tier</strong>.</p><ul><li>These temp Integrity last until the creature finishes a short or a Soma Break.</li><li>This applies once per instance of healing or stabilization.</li></ul><p>People walk away from your care buffered, not just patched.</p>",
